---
/**
 * A chip, in the register of a ruled index entry rather than a pill badge.
 * Bounded, mono, and quiet — it names a technology, not a personality.
 *
 * Content arrives through the default slot. Declaring `children` in Props and
 * rendering it does not work: Astro passes component children to <slot />, so
 * `{children}` here would be undefined and the chip would render empty.
 */
---

<span
  class="inline-flex items-center border border-rule px-2 py-[0.15rem] font-code text-[0.7rem] leading-normal tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-muted"
>
  <slot />
</span>
